<title>UK: Sullom Voe Brent liftings lower, half to U.S..</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe Brent liftings lower, half to U.S..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent blend loadings from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal slipped to 523,756 tonnes in the week to January 7, down from 864,908 the previous week, Shetland Islands Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>Just over 43 percent of the oil, 226,109 tonnes, was destined for refineries in the United States. The previous week 58 percent or almost 500,000 tonnes went transatlantic.</p>
